# NEXORA Environment Configuration
PROJECT_NAME="NEXORA: Intelligent multiagent for business planning startup"
TAGLINE="From Capital to Business."
VERSION="1.0.0"

# Database Configuration
# Default is local SQLite. For PostgreSQL: postgresql://user:password@localhost:5432/nexora_db
